\f0\fs24 \cf0 Add Nutrition to the harmonized GVHD metadata.\
\
Follow the "Harmonization Variable Additions" section of CLAUDE.md for all\
standing conventions.\
\
SHAPE: categorical covariate \
\
DEFINITION: Nutrition should be recorded as the type of nutritional support each patient received. \
\
COLUMNS\
Parenteral\
Enteral\
Mixed\
Oral\
\
\
PLACEMENT: this can come after disease.\
\
PER-STUDY CONSTRUCTION:\
- Artacho:  If parenteral.nutrition is yes then parenteral, otherwise enteral. \
- DAmico:  If only EN or PN is present in Nutritional_Regimen then enteral or parenteral respectively. Otherwise if both are present then mixed. \
- Fujimoto: not recorded\
- Ingham:   not recorded\
- Liu2017:  not recorded\
- Vallet:   use the collapsed nutrition category stored in nutrition. Parenterale should be parenteral. \
\
\
\
